            # `extra` is the operator string when the helper's Py_XX enum was
            # read (type-specialized / RichCompare path); None when only inlined
            # (e.g. str fast-path) — never guess. RICH_COMPARE helpers take
            # (operand1=rcx, operand2=rdx); no tstate.
